WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Can two inputs give the same output?

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:03.830
Yes.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:06.130
Square 3, and get 9.

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.870
Square −3, and also get 9.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:14.016
Two inputs, one output each. That's still a function.
